WEBVTT

01:05.197 --> 01:06.823
SMACK

02:44.171 --> 02:45.380
CONCEPTION COMPLETE

02:45.422 --> 02:46.464
3 MINUTES UNTIL BIRTH

02:46.757 --> 02:50.469
ANALYZING DNA HARVESTED
FROM BRUNO BUCCIARATI.
MERGE WITH HOST DNA FOR
INCUBATION AND TRACKING?

02:50.552 --> 02:52.220
1: YES. 2: NO.

03:12.658 --> 03:17.158
<i>Heavy stones of fate
are holding down my dreams</i>

03:17.996 --> 03:21.457
<i>It feels as if I'm being crushed</i>

03:23.252 --> 03:27.752
<i>I've been staggering around
with nowhere to hide</i>

03:28.424 --> 03:32.261
<i>But I will never give in</i>

03:32.302 --> 03:36.802
<i>I know there are fragments of hope
buried beneath all that rubble</i>

03:44.106 --> 03:48.606
<i>I will find them with my own hands
and turn this world upside down</i>

03:57.161 --> 04:01.661
<i>Fighting gold
We will shine one day</i>

04:03.125 --> 04:07.625
<i>As long as we continue to
believe in our own path</i>

04:10.215 --> 04:13.343
<i>We are unyielding souls</i>

04:13.427 --> 04:17.927
<i>Our battle against god
will keep raging on</i>

04:18.640 --> 04:23.140
<i>Until our final days
Fighting gold</i>

04:32.780 --> 04:37.201
EPISODE 17
BABYHEAD

06:30.397 --> 06:32.023
BIRTHING SUCCESSFUL

07:10.103 --> 07:11.229
WHAT DOES "FREAKIN MURDER" MEAN?

08:53.206 --> 08:55.333
I GOTTA GO PEE PEE.
WHAT SHOULD I DO?

09:18.273 --> 09:22.773
MOMMY IS YELLING AT ME
AND IS SAYING THAT I REEK
AND THAT I AM VILE AND DISGUSTING.

09:25.363 --> 09:27.323
I'VE GOT THE BEST MOMMY
IN THE WORLD.

09:31.286 --> 09:33.246
I'M HUNGRY…
WHAT SHOULD I DO?

09:39.086 --> 09:40.545
GIVE ME SOMETHING TO DRINK,
PLEASE LET ME HAVE A DRINK!

10:18.834 --> 10:23.171
BUCCIARATI'S DNA IS
CURRENTLY INACTIVE.
THE MATERIAL REMAINS AT REST
AT AN UNDISCLOSED LOCATION
IN THE NORTH.

10:43.525 --> 10:45.568
MELONE
BABYHEAD

14:12.776 --> 14:15.487
TRISH HAS BEEN ACQUIRED.
BUCCIARATI IS CURRENTLY
ALSO IN CAPTIVITY.
WHAT NOW, MASTER?

14:21.326 --> 14:24.287
I'M IN THE TURTLE…
A PERSON IS BLOCKING
THE ONLY EXIT.

14:24.371 --> 14:27.248
I DO NOT RECOGNIZE HIM.
I CANNOT LEAVE UNNOTICED.
WHAT DO I DO?

14:32.837 --> 14:35.297
UNDERSTOOD.
I WILL ELIMINATE THE ROOKIE
OCCUPYING SPACE BY THE EXIT.

15:41.239 --> 15:44.992
MISSION ACCOMPLISHED…
ALL IS QUIET,
NOW THAT I HAVE HIS THROAT.

16:07.223 --> 16:09.058
SHPANG

16:15.732 --> 16:18.067
MISSION NOT ACCOMPLISHED…
AS YOU COULD GUESS,
I'VE BEEN FIGURED OUT…
WHAT NOW?

16:21.154 --> 16:22.488
THE NEW GUY TOOK THE KEY FROM
THE BACK OF THAT TURTLE.

16:22.530 --> 16:24.573
IT SEEMS REMOVING HE KEY ALLOWS
ONLY LIVING ORGANISMS TO EXIT.

16:25.074 --> 16:26.909
MY BODY KEEPS RISING
HIGHER AND HIGHER…
WHAT DO I DO NOW?

16:34.667 --> 16:37.002
THAT IS CERTAINLY TRUE,
BUT I STILL HAVE THE EYE
I DISLODGED FROM HIM…
THAT EYE IS ALIVE.

17:04.489 --> 17:06.199
MELONE.
WHAT SHOULD I DO?
WHAT SHOULD I DO?
WHAT SHOULD I DO?

19:36.557 --> 19:40.602
RUMBLE

23:38.466 --> 23:41.969
EPISODE 18
VERSO VENEZIA!
